{"id":"b060448f50c005a8","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-finite.md","title":"finite","display":"df-finite — finite","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-finite","aliases":["57-df-finite"],"display":"df-finite — finite","depends_on":["[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-set-function]]","[[57-df-range]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite — finite"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfefbfbc01cdb9a1\" href=\"?note=dfefbfbc01cdb9a1\" title=\"57-df-set-function\">57-df-set-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range\">57-df-range</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是集合函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dfefbfbc01cdb9a1\" href=\"?note=dfefbfbc01cdb9a1\" title=\"57-df-set-function\">57-df-set-function</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ran}\">\\(\\mathrm{ran}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range\">57-df-range</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fin}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fin}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists f\\;\n(f:n\\to X\\land\\forall x,y\\in n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\mathrm{ran}(f)=X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists f\\;\n(f:n\\to X\\land\\forall x,y\\in n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\mathrm{ran}(f)=X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Finite}(X),\\qquad |X|&lt;\\aleph_0\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Finite}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Finite}(X),\\qquad |X|&lt;\\aleph_0\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Finite}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目按第 57 册原引用处所需接口在内部补齐；背景为 ZFC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-set-function","status":"resolved","id":"dfefbfbc01cdb9a1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-set-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-range","status":"resolved","id":"a23da7b2fd81c2fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-range]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 为集合；$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]；$f$ 是集合函数，见 [[57-df-set-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-set-function","status":"resolved","id":"dfefbfbc01cdb9a1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 为集合；$\\mathbb N$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]；$f$ 是集合函数，见 [[57-df-set-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-range","status":"resolved","id":"a23da7b2fd81c2fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ran}$ 取 [[57-df-range]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists f\\;\n(f:n\\to X\\land\\forall x,y\\in n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\mathrm{ran}(f)=X).","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Finite}(X),\\qquad |X|<\\aleph_0\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Finite}(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1031,"backlinks":[{"id":"40d1acedbbf319e7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_S$ 且 $\\mathrm{Finite}(N)$，见 [[57-df-clause]]、[[57-df-finite]]。文字、$\\mathrm{atom}$、$\\mathrm{pol}$、$\\overline L$ 见 [[57-df-literal]]。"},{"id":"9de5f7f1ae7b9565","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)$ (有穷集合, see [[57-df-finite]])"},{"id":"f570926126f9a186","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_